flowchart TB
    CLIENT[API Client / Frontend]

    CLIENT --> GW[API Gateway / Controller Layer]

    GW --> APP[Application Layer]
    APP --> DOMAIN[Domain / Business Logic]
    DOMAIN --> REPO[Repository Layer]

    REPO --> DB[(Database)]
    DOMAIN --> CACHE[(Cache)]
    DOMAIN --> MQ[(Message Broker)]

    APP --> EXT[External Services]